OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid after death of
OL,4,Apedestrian hit by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family paid tribute to a
OL,7,F"one-of-a-kind" father, grandfather and
OL,8,Fhusband who died three weeks after he
OL,9,Fwas hit by a car as a pedestrian.
OL,11,FMatt McKee, 51, from Corby,
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire, died in hospital
OL,13,Fafter the collision on the A414 near
OL,14,Fthe junction with Buncefield Lane in
OL,15,FHemel Hempstead.
OL,17,FHertfordshire Police said he was struck
OL,18,Fby a silver Hyundai i10 at about 10:35
OL,19,FBST on 22 July.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
